Subject: [PATCH 44/44] engine: a command hook on Session::execute (before may
 refuse, after sees the result)

Nothing is installed by default; without a hook execute takes its former path. The office layer installs one
for the XDFU policy and the version snapshot on save (docs/phase4/PLAN.md section 4).
